OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners await platform
OL,4,Aextension study verdict
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners hoping to get a more
OL,7,Ffrequent rail service at a station are
OL,8,F"waiting anxiously" on the results of a
OL,9,Fsurvey looking into the possibility of
OL,10,Fextending the platforms.
OL,12,FOn average currently only about 30% of
OL,13,Fthe trains which pass through Ivybridge
OL,14,Fstation stop there, a main factor of
OL,15,Fthis being the short 104m (341ft)
OL,16,Fplatforms.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,347,340,200,160,0,100
