OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners await platform
OL,4,Aextension study verdict
OL,5,
OL,6,FNetwork Rail have conducted the #20,000
OL,7,Ffeasibility survey, which was funded by
OL,8,FSouth Hams District Council into the
OL,9,Fpossible expansion of the platforms,
OL,10,Fwith the final costings being
OL,11,F"undertaken and expect the report to be
OL,12,Fready later this month".
OL,14,FGWR and Cross Country both support and
OL,15,Fwelcome the proposals in a bid to
OL,16,Fimprove rail services offered in the
OL,17,Ftown.
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
